ll,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571793475","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-2571793475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98474","id":2571793475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSnRD","user":{"login":"smmathew","id":18320794,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzIwNzk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18320794?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew","html_url":"https://github.com/smmathew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T23:46:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T23:46:12Z","body":"@kdaker I am still getting \"Invalid project path specified: \"jumper_jam\", aborting.\" After godot loads on the phone after following your instructions. Any idea why it can't find the folder after I added it?<img width=\"267\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bc9ddb0-1644-4714-9d1b-25135c8d9d76\" />\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571793475/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571795035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-2571795035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98474","id":2571795035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSnpb","user":{"login":"smmathew","id":18320794,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzIwNzk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18320794?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew","html_url":"https://github.com/smmathew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smmathew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T23:50:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T23:50:57Z","body":"@kdaker I got it working! I had to go add the folder in the copy build phase. Thanks for your help the key I was missing was the \"apply once to folder\".\n\n<img width=\"534\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0efb5681-cbf9-4eef-bad2-cd7f1e772894\" />\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571795035/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702652359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-2702652359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98474","id":2702652359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hFzPH","user":{"login":"yemibox51","id":19742642,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzQyNjQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19742642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51","html_url":"https://github.com/yemibox51","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yemibox51/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T02:51:25Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T02:51:25Z","body":"Using this method significantly increases the size of the app. Has anyone found a way to decrease it without switching back to the `.pck`?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702652359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708973436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-2708973436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98474","id":2708973436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hd6d8","user":{"login":"alkhimey","id":652603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjYwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/652603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey","html_url":"https://github.com/alkhimey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alkhimey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T17:25:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T16:33:28Z","body":"The method endorsed by the documentation requires copying the whole project directory into the bundle, this will include `.git` directory, `.godot` directory with all the build intermediate artifacts and any other hidden or irrelevant files you might have in the project directory. \n\nIt takes time to copy and makes the app bundle huge. A starter mono project will have a size greater than 1GB (after exporting for release and debug once). Additionally one should not use this method when exporting to production but it is easy to forget or overlook this.\n\nWhat I recommend is to add a build phase to the Xcode project to re-generate PCK for each build.\n\nFor mono projects, it is also required to copy `iOS-Game-Test_aot.xcframework` (replace \"iOS-Game-Test\" with you project's name). The process that generates PCK already builds an xcframework for Release. There is no need to do it specifically for Debug as debugging is not possible anyway.\n\nIn Xcode, the commands should be added to a \"build phase\" that happens before linking.\n\n```sh\nGODO_PROJECT_ROOT=~/Documents/Projects/Godot-Experimentation/ios-game-test\n\n/Applications/Godot_mono.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --headless --path $GODO_PROJECT_ROOT --export-pack iOS ${PROJECT_DIR}/${PROJECT_NAME}.pck\n\ncp -r $GODO_PROJECT_ROOT/.godot/mono/temp/bin/ExportRelease/iOS-Game-Test_aot.xcframework ${PROJECT_DIR}/${PROJECT_NAME}/dylibs/ExportDebug\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a690b90b-e827-43af-933e-a5b046b55237)\n\nI found this method to be faster. Maybe for bigger projects it will become too slow eventually but for me it works so far. \n\nAdditonaly, I believe that if needed, is possible to tell Xcode which files this build phase depends on and run the script only when something in the Godot project changes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708973436/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768032595","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-2768032595","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98474","id":2768032595,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k_NNT","user":{"login":"dannys42","id":207711,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207711?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42","html_url":"https://github.com/dannys42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannys42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T04:00:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T04:01:32Z","body":"I'm just starting with Godot, so I don't know whether it's better to have PCK files or the bundle.  I'll definitely look into the PCK steps at some point.  But for now I just wanted to experiment with Godot.  So for anyone else in a similar position that just wants to find the minimal steps needed to go from the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.html) to a working iOS build, this is what worked for me after following some of the steps people mentioned above:\n\n- Drag the godot project into your Xcode project workspace\n    -  Action: Reference files in place\n    - Groups: Create folders\n    - Target membership: disable\n- Select the godot project in the Project navigator.  \n- Then in the File Inspector:\n    - Location: Relative to Project\n    - Build Rules: Apply Once to a Folder\n    - Target Membership: (add your project here)\n\nAnd of course don't forget to modify your Project-Info.plist as mentioned in the documentation:\n - set \"godot_path\" to the name of your godot reference folder\n\nTested on:\n\n- Xcode 16.3\n- Minimum iOS 14.0 \n- Target iOS device: 18.3.2\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768032595/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807809166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-2807809166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issu