tps://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge","html_url":"https://github.com/MadGeorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadGeorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T12:21:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T12:21:26Z","body":"Still a valid issue in 4.4.1-stable","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3062113921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239542377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98474#issuecomment-3239542377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98474","id":3239542377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BF35p","user":{"login":"owlnewworlds","id":156072785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCU17UQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156072785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds","html_url":"https://github.com/owlnewworlds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T21:09:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T21:09:01Z","body":"> Still a valid issue in 4.4.1-stable\n\nYes, it's crazy how uselessly complex iOS export is and how it didn't change for years. I've been using Godot for 2 years and a half and the state of iOS Godot is the same : complex and nerves crisis export, outdated and not maintained and incompatible native plugins...\n\nIt's even more crazy to know that some devs from Apple joined the contributors for Vision stuff. I wonder how they were able to work with such conditions... or maybe I'm just stupid, but it seems all the mobile Godot developers have issues with iOS.\n\nSorry, didn't want to be rude or what. The community is amazing, I was just trying to make a new update for iOS and back to errors and crazy stuff :( I really hope one day something will be done regarding iOS. It's so freaking EASY to export to Android !","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239542377/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]